WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.580
Your Majesty,
please do not attend the parade.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.120
The parade will be carried out as scheduled.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.580
If the demons mean to interfere,
we will merely slaughter them all.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.460
Why is she not coming?

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.460
The demons are scheming something.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.180
The parade will commence at noon.
We have to find and stop them before then!

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.640
Why did you not show up
where we were supposed to meet?

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.480
Because I was watching the parade!

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.020
Just come! We're out of time!

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.070
This is where we battle the demons.

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:46.200
Finally.
It is time we settle this once and for all.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.160
I will draw them to me.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.080
I want you to live!

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.270
Where did Mugaro go?

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.020
This way? That way?

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.780
Which way?

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.270
Is that...

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:04.530
Mugaro!

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:09.870
So this is the power the gods seek.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.580
Your Majesty!

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:01.170
Rage of Bahamut

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.340
What are you doing?

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.760
This fight can't be settled like this.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:33.180
Are you suggesting I let a demon
who is after my life go free?

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:46.360
I am done listening to your nonsense!

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:56.280
I told you I would eliminate you
if you interfered.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.570
This demon will die if I defeat you!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.620
You still believe the three races can
live in peace, do you not?

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.340
Then try to fight for it here.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.240
Kill me.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.620
The fight is over.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.580
It is not over!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:33.130
There should be no reason
for you to die here.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.600
Mugaro!

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.530
Your Majesty, are you injured?

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.120
So they show themselves. Contemptible gods.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.970
Where are you going, Mugaro?

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.860
Turn into a dragon!

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:37.650
Nina!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.240
You have to transform!

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.030
What? What are you saying?

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.950
We need your power now!

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.580
You have to save Mugaro!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:51.620
You have to save the demons!

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:39.360
It's not working! I can't transform!

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.280
What?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:10.300
Damn it all!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.930
Rage of Bahamut

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:17.600
The Rag Demon has finally been caught!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.900
King Charioce did it!

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:25.320
I can't believe a knight captain
was aiding the demons.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.280
How far the Orleans Knights have fallen.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:30.280
I've seen the captain before.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.080
Sir, there's gotta be some sort of mistake
with this girl Nina.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:37.080
She's not someone who could do anything
like this!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.750
That's right! Nina's such a good,
cheerful girl.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:41.920
Yeah!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:45.670
When I put her on my shoulders yesterday
so she could see the parade better,

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.970
she was so happy.

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:51.180
There's no way she attacked the king after that.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:57.230
Please, could you talk to the king
and ask him to look into it one more time?

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.520
If you defend this traitor any more,

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.270
I'll throw you all into prison too!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.700
What did they do?

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:16.080
The drunk and the duck
have run off too.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.420
I will now read the charges.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.000
First, the accused, Kaisar Lidfard.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:26.840
You have been accused of consorting with demons

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:30.970
while having sworn to protect His Majesty
as captain of the Orleans Knights.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.890
You aided the rebels with their attack on the parade,

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:39.140
and together with the Rag Demon,
raised your sword against His Majesty,

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:41.350
for which there can be no justification!

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:45.020
-These are crimes against the sovereign.
-What did he want to do?

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:47.820
And you are hereby charged with treason!

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:56.160
It's no use. I'm not getting excited at all.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.370
The accused, Nina Drango.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.920
You are accused of sympathizing with
dangerous demon ideology despite being human,

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.710
and, additionally, aiding in the parade attacks.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.880
There are also suspicions of your connection

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.720
with a red dragon
that has emerged in the last few days,

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.720
and it is evident you are a member of the rebellion.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:20.180
Therefore, you will also
be charged with treason!

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.690
Your Majesty, your judgment, please.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.900
Please.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:29.690
Imprison both in the prison tower,

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:31.650
where they will be held indefinitely.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.320
What? Indefinitely?

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:36.080
Take them away!

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:43.370
What? No! Wait, wait, wait!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:47.630
Indefinitely? You've gotta be kidding!
Could you make it more like three days?

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:52.470
Indefinitely is way too harsh.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.840
Wait.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.690
What are you looking at?

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.410
Just so you know,

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:20.080
I don't think you're a good king or anything.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:23.540
Doesn't the king have to be nice to everyone?

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:27.080
Picking on folks because they're demons,
putting collars on them,

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.670
hurting them to make them do what you say-

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.170
do you really think that's okay?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:36.800
When this whole capital was built by demons!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:39.390
When actually you need them!

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.810
How could you just kill them
without a thought?

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.890
You’re nothing but a big bully!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:52.280
Everyone says you're a great king
who made the capital rich,

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.860
but it's all a lie!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.610
You're just an evil king!

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:02.160
A worthless king who just sits on his throne,
picking on the weak demons!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.880
Humans and demons may be scared of you,

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.420
but not me!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:13.460
I'm not the least bit scared of you!

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:23.270
What are you laughing at?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.730
Shut your mouth al-

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:33.110
Are you the red dragon?

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:37.110
No. I have no idea what you’re referring to.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.290
Take them away.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.790
-Get up!
-Stop!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.500
-Come on!
-That hurts!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.900
Lady Gabriel.

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.150
The child is awake.

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.700
There is nothing to fear.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.700
The gods here

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:29.670
are all on your side.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.090
Your name is El.

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:43.350
It is the name your mother Jeanne D'Arc
gave you.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:47.100
Do you not wish to see your mother?

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.690
Do you not wish to save your mother?

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.810
If you join forces with us,

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.690
you will be able to meet your mother.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:15.960
Forget it.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.460
Why’d we have to return to heaven this way?

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:24.800
We should have told Lady Sofiel about Mugaro
when we had the chance.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:28.270
Hamsa is right.

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:34.980
Lady Sofiel! Please let us free!

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:41.070
We planned to tell you that this was the child you
were seeking once we gathered enough evidence!

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:44.360
I assure you we had no intention of betraying you.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.370
Why did you hide the child?

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.290
Answer me.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.580
I just felt like it.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.290
You just felt like it?

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.710
What do you mean by that?

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.800
There's no meaning.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.670
Are you a fool?

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.800
He really is!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:08.180
And what are you looking to start with that kid?

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:13.020
Humans have lost their way,

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:17.980
and Lady Gabriel wishes to guide them
back to offering their prayers to the gods.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:22.150
And you'll be using the kid for that?

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:29.490
The child's power is the only thing capable of
breaking the forbidden magic used by humans.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.540
Leave the kid out of this!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.620
It’ll be Jeanne D'Arc all over again.

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:39.090
You overstep your bounds.

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.130
A thousand apologies, Lady Sofiel.

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:49.140
He's just a little irritated
because he hasn't had his drink.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.600
The fact remains that you interfered with our mission.

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:55.390
You would do well to think about
what you've done here.

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:01.360
Why is this happening to us?

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.820
Maybe you backed the humans too much on this one.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.860
Shut up.

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:10.120
That reminds me. When we were teleporting away

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.330
the young lady was yelling from below.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.920
I wonder what's happened to her.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.760
I hope she's okay...

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.930
You can see it now.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:30.430
That's your new home.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:33.310
Pretty nice, isn't it?

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:38.190
It's an impregnable and unescapable
underground dungeon.

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:41.980
Hey, what happened to the Rag Demon?

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:45.530
Probably getting tortured as we speak.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:49.530
Trying to get him to spill about who else
is working with him.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:53.490
Hey, don't talk to the prisoners.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:56.250
Who cares? Nobody's even around!

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.710
You're always getting worked up about nothing.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.380
I'm sorry, Azazel.

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:05.710
If only I was able to transform into a dragon, then...

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:22.900
Just spill it already!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.030
Tell me where your base is!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.500
How unsightly.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:54.010
Did you know what the taken child was?

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.020
You really had no idea.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.900
What a fool.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:06.540
The gods were desperate to get the child.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:09.840
I planned to kill the child
before he fell into their hands,

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:13.050
but you ruined it all.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.470
No matter.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:20.020
The gods are overconfident now that they
have the child. So I will simply kill them all.

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:21.890
When I do,

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:25.270
that woman will surely stop praying.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:28.610
That woman...

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:33.610
The former saint...

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:37.030
Jeanne...

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:39.450
D'Arc.

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:57.010
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:01.220
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:05.100
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:09.360
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:11.860
So fragile
Yet strong

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.990
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:17.990
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:22.240
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:26.330
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:30.630
Let's end it all today

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:34.920
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:39.220
Let's end it all today

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:43.770
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:22:44.560 --> 00:22:52.570
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:57.400
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:04.410
A new morning is coming

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:15.710
Get in there!

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:22.850
Do you really have to be so rough?

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:26.100
Honestly!

00:23:27.390 --> 00:23:31.100
Well, well. If it isn't the great and noble knight,
gracing us with his presence.

00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:36.360
I keep telling you to pay more attention
to your surroundings, don't I?

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:43.870
Hey.

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:49.370
- It's the aristocrat, Kaisar!
- Demon Azazel here!

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:51.620
- I challenge you to a battle!
- Bring it on!

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:55.380
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "Same Old. Same Old."

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:57.300
- Ready!
- Rock, Paper!

00:23:58.090 --> 00:24:01.090
- R-r-ro-rock!
- Hey!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.970
Baha Soul!!

00:24:04.260 --> 00:24:07.140
Baha Baha Bahasoul.

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:10.890
You there.
You must watch next time too, understood?
